# Job Application Tracker API

A backend API built with **FastAPI** and **SQLite** to manage users and job/internship applications.

---

## Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Python | Programming language |
| FastAPI | Web framework |
| SQLAlchemy | ORM / database interaction |
| SQLite | Database (`app.db`) |
| Uvicorn | ASGI server |

---

## How to Run

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd "Backend API"

# 2. Create and activate virtual environment
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate

# 3. Install dependencies
pip install fastapi uvicorn sqlalchemy pydantic

# 4. Start the server
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Open your browser at **http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs** to explore all endpoints interactively.

---

## Endpoints

### Users

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/users` | Create a new user |
| `GET` | `/users` | Get all users |
| `GET` | `/users/{user_id}` | Get a user by ID |

### Applications

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/applications/` | Submit a new application |
| `GET` | `/applications/` | Get all applications *(requires `X-Role: recruiter` header)* |
| `GET` | `/applications/{app_id}` | Get a single application |

---

## Example Requests

**Create a user**
```json
POST /users
{
  "name": "Jihane",
  "email": "jihane@example.com"
}
```

**Submit an application**
```json
POST /applications/
{
  "user_id": 1,
  "company": "Google",
  "position": "Backend Intern"
}
```

---

## Project Structure

```
Backend API/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py       ← FastAPI app & routes
│   ├── models.py     ← SQLAlchemy models
│   ├── schemas.py    ← Pydantic schemas
│   ├── crud.py       ← Database operations
│   └── database.py  ← DB connection
├── app.db            ← SQLite database (auto-created)
└── README.md
```
